option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of direct sunlight. 100 = vanilla-like.
option.MOONLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of moonlight at night. 100 = default.
option.SKYLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of directional ambient (skylight-based) lighting.
option.MIN_AMBIENT.comment=Floor value for ambient light in dark areas, so caves never turn pitch black.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of light emitted by torches, lava, glowstone etc.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_SUPPRESSION.comment=Blocklight fades as daylight gets stronger; replaces auto exposure without flicker.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING.comment=Dynamic light around the player while holding a light-emitting block.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Intensity of the handheld dynamic light.
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH.comment=Lightning bolts light up the surroundings and the sky.
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH.comment=Boost for emissive surfaces (glowstone, lava, portals...).
option.SHADOWS.comment=Master switch for the shadow map. (Performance: high impact overall)
option.SHADOW_RESOLUTION.comment=Shadow map resolution. (Performance: high)
option.SHADOW_DISTANCE.comment=How far shadows are rendered, in blocks. (Performance: high)
option.ENTITY_SHADOW_DISTANCE.comment=Distance at which entities cast shadows. (Performance: medium)
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Edge softening radius of the shadow filter, in texels (max 16). (Performance: medium)
option.COLORED_SHADOWS.comment=Stained glass and water cast tinted shadows; clear glass casts none.
option.STATIC_SHADOW_FALLBACK.comment=Skylight-based shadow approximation beyond the shadow distance, blended over 5-10 blocks.
option.SSS_FOLIAGE.comment=Leaves and plants let some light through from behind.
option.SSS_STRENGTH.comment=Intensity of the foliage translucency effect.
option.SKY_MODE.comment=0 = Minishita mini physical atmosphere (recommended), 1 = simple gradient (fastest).
option.SUN_MOON_MODE.comment=0 = vanilla sun/moon textures, 1 = procedural discs.
option.STARS.comment=Night star field with subtle twinkle.
option.CLOUD_MODE.comment=0 = vanilla clouds (retinted), 1 = planar wispy clouds, 2 = off. (Planar: low cost)
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=Coverage of the planar cloud layer (Clouds = Planar only).
option.AIR_PERSPECTIVE.comment=Horizon picks up a warm tint toward the sun at sunrise/sunset.
option.BIOME_TINT.comment=Fog and ambient light get a subtle tint from biome temperature/humidity.
option.BIOME_TINT_STRENGTH.comment=Intensity of the biome tint.
option.END_NEBULA.comment=Faint nebula layer in the End sky.
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Animated water surface normals.
option.WATER_WAVE_HEIGHT.comment=Amplitude of water waves. (Performance: low)
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED.comment=Flow speed of the water surface.
option.SCREENSPACE_REFLECTIONS.comment=SSR on water and ice top faces; falls back to sky reflection. (Performance: high)
option.SCREENSPACE_REFRACTION.comment=Single-jump refraction under the water surface with depth rejection. (Performance: medium)
option.REFRACTION_STRENGTH.comment=Distortion strength of the refraction.
option.WATER_ABSORPTION.comment=Exponential color absorption underwater; 0 = off. (Performance: low)
option.WATER_CHARACTER.comment=Water palette: 0 = Cold, 1 = Balanced, 2 = Tropical.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Light patterns on the seafloor, cast along with shadows.
option.UNDERWATER_PARTICLES.comment=Suspended particles while underwater. (Performance: medium)
option.FANCY_TRANSLUCENTS.comment=Premultiplied-alpha blending for water/translucents; enables free reflection/refraction mixing. (Performance: low)
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Density of distance fog. (Performance: negligible)
option.SKY_FOG_STRENGTH.comment=How much fog blends into the sky; low values also skip sky fog color work.
option.BORDER_FOG.comment=Fog at the render-distance border.
option.CAVE_FOG.comment=Fog inside caves.
option.UNDERWATER_FOG_DENSITY.comment=Density of underwater fog. (Performance: negligible)
option.NETHER_FOG_DENSITY.comment=Nether fog density with its own height/density curve. (Performance: negligible)
option.END_FOG_DENSITY.comment=End void fog gradient density. (Performance: negligible)
option.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.comment=0 = Uchimura (default), 1 = AgX, 2 = ACES, 3 = Reinhard-Jodie.
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Color grading: overall exposure. (Performance: negligible)
option.SATURATION.comment=Color grading: saturation (factory default 112, Refrax-style target).
option.VIBRANCE.comment=Color grading: vibrance - saturation weighted toward less-saturated colors (factory 115).
option.CONTRAST.comment=Color grading: contrast (factory default 104).
option.COLOR_TEMPERATURE.comment=Color grading: warm/cool shift. Negative = cooler.
option.BLOOM.comment=Soft glow around bright areas. (Performance: low)
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Intensity of the bloom.
option.GODRAYS.comment=Volumetric light shafts when looking at the sun/moon through gaps. (Performance: medium; off by default)
option.GODRAYS_STRENGTH.comment=Intensity of the godrays.
option.DITHERING.comment=Interleaved gradient noise on output; removes banding. Keep on without AA.
option.VIGNETTE.comment=Darkened screen corners. Off by default (clean look).
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE.comment=Gentle vertex-animated sway for leaves and plants. (Performance: low)
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE_STRENGTH.comment=Intensity of the foliage sway.
option.VOXY_SUPPORT.comment=Render Voxy distant chunks with Astra lighting. Experimental on 26.x.

